  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1307.01 Nomination for Diagnostic and Feasibility Study",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1307.01 Nomination for Diagnostic and Feasibility Study.\n\n(a) A nomination for water body for inclusion in the diagnostic and feasibility study program established under RSA 487:21, I, shall be filed:\n\n(1) By a municipality or an organization, such as a lake association, that is in good standing with the New Hampshire secretary of state; and\n\n(2) For a surface water that meets the eligibility criteria specified in Env-Wq 1307.02.\n\n(b) The nominating entity shall provide the information specified in Env-Wq 1307.03 in writing to the NHDES limnology center director and clean lakes program coordinator.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note 1 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300) #8703-A, eff 9-5-06; amd by #9488, eff 6-23-09 ss by #10696, eff 10-18-14 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1300); ss bv #14186, eff 1-25-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1300.html"
